# the checker of frames asks of each head of the framed part what the allocator asks: a parameter that is spilled and has no register at its definition is stored where no frame stands
# REQUIRES: x86_64 unsanitized-code
# PROGRAM-OF: phi-that-got-no-register-at-a-head-of-the-framed-part-lies-in-the-frame-of-the-entry.ir
# OPTIONS: check=Validate
# RUN: allocate f5:Body mechanisms=all
# CHECK-LABEL: unit f5:Body
# CHECK: needsFrameAheadOfFramedPart
# RUN(LOOPED): allocate f4:Body mechanisms=all
# LOOPED-LABEL: unit f4:Body
# LOOPED: needsFrameAheadOfFramedPart
